		"Changes within seconds": "几秒内同步更改",
		"A workflow of Paperless calls this webhook when it adds or changes a document, and the copy of the document changes within seconds instead of with the next scheduled run. Trashed and deleted documents wait for the scheduled runs.": "Paperless 的工作流在添加或更改文档时会调用此 Webhook，文档的副本会在几秒内更新，而不必等待下次定时运行。移入回收站和已删除的文档则等待定时运行处理。",
		"Webhook URL": "Webhook URL",
		"Copy": "复制",
		"Secret": "密钥",
		"Copy the secret now: it is shown only this once. In Paperless, it goes into the header Authorization of the webhook, as Bearer followed by a space and the secret.": "请立即复制密钥：它只显示这一次。在 Paperless 中，将其填入 Webhook 的 Authorization 标头，格式为 Bearer、一个空格和密钥。",
		"Turn the webhook off": "关闭 Webhook",
		"Mirror the document during the call": "在调用期间镜像文档",
		"Off, the document waits for the next background jobs, which system cron starts every 5 minutes. On, it waits only while another run is active.": "关闭时，文档会等待下一批后台任务，系统 cron 每 5 分钟启动一次。开启时，文档仅在另一次运行进行中时等待。",
		"Set up the workflow in Paperless": "在 Paperless 中设置工作流",
		"In Paperless, open Workflows and add a workflow, with the triggers Document Added and Document Updated.": "在 Paperless 中打开“工作流”并添加一个工作流，触发器为“文档已添加”和“文档已更新”。",
		"Add the action Webhook, with the webhook URL above as its Webhook url.": "添加操作 Webhook，并将上方的 Webhook URL 填入其“Webhook 链接”。",
		"Turn on \"Use parameters for webhook body\" and \"Send webhook payload as JSON\", and add the parameter document with the value {{ doc_id }}. Paperless-ngx 2.x has no {{ doc_id }}: use {{ doc_url }} there.": "开启“使用参数作为webhook负载”和“以 JSON 格式发送网络钩子的有效负载 (webhook payload)”，并添加参数 document，其值为 {{ doc_id }}。Paperless-ngx 2.x 没有 {{ doc_id }}：请在那里改用 {{ doc_url }}。",
		"Under Webhook headers, add Authorization with the value Bearer, a space and the secret, and save the workflow.": "在“Webhook标头”下添加 Authorization，其值为 Bearer、一个空格和密钥，然后保存工作流。",
		"Change the title of a document in Paperless: its copy moves within seconds, and the last call appears here.": "在 Paperless 中更改某个文档的标题：其副本会在几秒内移动，最近一次调用会显示在这里。",
